                                                "sense_id": "dbeafc98-452a-3302-8d16-c55957a2ba42",
                                                "text": "The statements of Mr. Sulman and Mr. Picard, two Minerals Separation engineers, […] form an interesting comparison"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c81e8fc0-d66c-4bfb-8550-9c49e515160b",
                                                "sense_id": "dbeafc98-452a-3302-8d16-c55957a2ba42",
